Derived from Megvii's COCO-pretrained yolox_nano checkpoint
(Megvii-BaseDetection/YOLOX), licensed under Apache-2.0; the text is in
LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt. Changed by Ohm Lab: trained in PixelKit to find
circles and squares, exported to ONNX and quantised to int8.

The training images were drawn by a script from fixed seeds and contain no
third-party content.
